            {
              "id": "art-body",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 9
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Unexpected breakdowns rarely happen at a convenient time.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "For owner-operators and fleet managers, one missed delivery can quickly turn into lost revenue, frustrated customers, and added pressure on an already tight schedule. A well-structured semi truck maintenance checklist helps eliminate guesswork and gives you a clear plan to protect your equipment, your drivers, and your business.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, we work with hardworking drivers across Florida who rely on consistency, honesty, and dependable service. This checklist is designed to support long-term reliability, not just pass inspections, but keep trucks performing day after day.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-why-checklist",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Every Operation Needs a Semi Truck Maintenance Checklist",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "why-checklist"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-checklist-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A proactive preventive maintenance checklist keeps small issues from becoming expensive repairs. Preventive maintenance can reduce vehicle downtime while extending overall equipment life. That kind of savings adds up quickly for owner-operators and small fleets trying to stay profitable. More importantly, routine maintenance builds confidence. When drivers trust their equipment, they drive safer, plan better routes, and avoid unnecessary stress.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-daily-inspection",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Daily Truck Inspection List: Start Every Trip Right",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "daily-inspection"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-daily-inspection-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Daily inspections are your first line of defense. This truck inspection list should be completed before every trip:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-1-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "fig-1-col",
                      "type": "column",
                      "props": {
                        "span": 12
                      },
                      "styles": {
                        "base": {
                          "marginTop": 8,
                          "marginBottom": 24,
                          "radius": 4,
                          "overflow": "hidden"
                        }
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "fig-1",
                          "type": "image",
                          "props": {
                            "width": "full",
                            "image": {
                              "src": "/img/blog/semi-truck-maintenance-checklist/1.jpg",
                              "width": 1280,
                              "height": 720,
                              "alt": "Daily truck inspection list covering fluids, tires, lights, brakes, and mirrors"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-daily-inspection-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Fluids",
                        "text": "— Engine oil, coolant, DEF, windshield washer fluid"
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Tires",
                        "text": "— Inflation, tread depth, sidewall damage"
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Lights & Electrical",
                        "text": "— Headlights, brake lights, turn signals"
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Brakes",
                        "text": "— Air pressure, warning indicators, audible leaks"
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Mirrors & Wipers",
                        "text": "— Visibility and secure mounting"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-daily-inspection-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "These checks don't take long, but they help catch problems before they leave you stranded on the shoulder.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-weekly-checklist",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Weekly Preventive Maintenance Checklist",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "weekly-checklist"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-weekly-checklist-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Weekly inspections allow you to dig a little deeper and spot wear early:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-weekly-checklist-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Battery connections and corrosion"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Air filters and intake system"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Suspension components and shocks"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Visible fluid leaks"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Exhaust and emission system indicators"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-weekly-checklist-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Following a weekly preventive maintenance checklist keeps your truck road-ready while reducing surprise service visits.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-monthly-guide",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Monthly Semi Truck Maintenance Guide",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "monthly-guide"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-monthly-guide-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A monthly semi truck maintenance guide focuses on performance-critical systems:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-monthly-guide-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Engine diagnostics and fault codes"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Brake lining and drum wear"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Transmission fluid levels"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Steering alignment and handling"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Cooling system condition"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-monthly-guide-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "This is also a good time to review service records and adjust your fleet truck service plan based on mileage, load weight, and driving conditions. Need parts you can trust? Visit the Sun State International Parts Department to get quality components that keep your maintenance plan on track.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-monthly-guide-4-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
