                {
                  "id": "h-quarterly-plan",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Quarterly and Seasonal Fleet Truck Service Plan",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "quarterly-plan"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-quarterly-plan-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "For businesses running multiple units, a structured fleet truck service plan ensures consistency across the entire operation. Quarterly or seasonal service should include:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-quarterly-plan-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Full engine and drivetrain inspection"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Cooling system service before peak summer months"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Brake system testing and adjustments"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "HVAC performance checks"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Software and system updates"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-quarterly-plan-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Florida's heat, humidity, and stop-and-go traffic can accelerate wear, making seasonal maintenance especially important.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-dot-compliance",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "DOT Inspections and Compliance Readiness",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "dot-compliance"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-dot-compliance-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A strong truck fleet maintenance checklist also supports DOT compliance. Regular inspections help ensure:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-dot-compliance-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Brake systems meet federal safety standards"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Tires and wheels remain road-legal"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Lighting and reflective markings are visible"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Safety equipment is present and functional"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-dot-compliance-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Well-documented maintenance records make roadside inspections smoother and protect your operation from avoidable violations.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-quality-parts",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The Role of Quality Parts in Preventive Maintenance",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "quality-parts"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-quality-parts-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Even the best checklist can fall short if low-quality parts are used. Reliable components reduce repeat repairs, improve safety, and protect long-term performance. While cheaper parts may look appealing upfront, they often lead to more downtime and higher labor costs. Sun State International offers dependable parts designed to meet heavy-duty demands, helping owner-operators stay focused on the road, not repeat repairs.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-professional-service",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When Professional Service Makes the Difference",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "professional-service"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-professional-service-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Some maintenance tasks are best handled by trained technicians with the right diagnostic tools. Professional service is recommended for:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-professional-service-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Engine performance concerns"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Brake system repairs"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Transmission and driveline issues"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Electrical and emissions diagnostics"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-professional-service-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When it's time for expert support, schedule service with Sun State International and work with a team that respects your time, your truck, and your livelihood.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-long-term-advantage",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Turning a Checklist Into a Long-Term Advantage",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "long-term-advantage"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-long-term-advantage-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The most effective semi truck maintenance checklist is one that becomes part of your routine. Keep it simple, stay consistent, and document every service. Over time, maintenance trends emerge, helping you plan repairs, budget accurately, and avoid costly downtime.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-long-term-advantage-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, parts and service are about more than fixing problems. They're about helping drivers and fleets build something dependable, mile after mile. With the right checklist and the right support, your trucks can stay productive, safe, and ready for whatever the road brings.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
